abstract: >-
  An OCR engine in C++ and CUDA, and Fullerene, its family of small models. It reads
  scans, photos of documents and PDFs into text, HTML, markdown and JSON with boxes, in reading order with
  labeled blocks and table cells, on CPUs and NVIDIA GPUs.
keywords: [ocr, document-understanding, onnx, cuda, tensorrt]
